                    "description": "This model may not be targeted for attacks unless the attacking model is within 6”. In addition, friendly Eldar units within 12” of the Webway Gate receive the benefit of Light Cover. If they are already benefiting from Light Cover, they gain the Benefit of Heavy Cover instead.",
